# Where assistant-generated artwork, exports and one-off working files go. This
# repo builds a website; binary deliverables like logo kits, wristband codes and
# social exports are outputs of a conversation, not inputs to the build, and they
# run to megabytes each. Anything the site actually ships belongs in `public/`
# or `sponsor-logos/` instead. See AGENTS.md.
scratch/
brand-assets/
